claim.claim-text:
performing (201) signal parsing on input signals to obtain low frequency signals and high frequency signals;
encoding (202) the low frequency signals;
performing (203) a time frequency transformation process on the high frequency signals;
performing (204) a classification decision process on the high frequency signals after the time frequency transformation, wherein the type of the high frequency signals is either a transient signal or a non-transient signal;
adaptively encoding (205) the high frequency signals according to the result of the classification decision process; and
outputting (206) a bitstream including encoded bitstream of the low frequency signals, adaptive encoded bitstream of the high frequency signals, and the result of the classification decision process;
wherein the adaptively encoding (205) comprises:
